KSeF Foundry — third-party material

The directory `schemas/` contains unmodified copies of official material
published by the Polish Ministry of Finance (Ministerstwo Finansów) in
https://github.com/CIRFMF/ksef-api (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025
Ministerstwo Finansów):

  - schemas/openapi/*.json   OpenAPI contracts of the KSeF API 2.0
                             (TEST, DEMO, PRODUCTION)
  - schemas/xsd/**           XSD schemas FA(2), FA(3), AuthTokenRequest, UPO

Files under `schemas/xsd/**/resolved/` (if present) are derived copies in which
only `schemaLocation` attributes were rewritten to local relative paths so that
validation can run without network access. See scripts/ for the generator.

KSeF Foundry is an independent open-source project. It is not affiliated with
or endorsed by the Ministry of Finance.
